摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Installable Codex skill for commercial UI/UX/GUI design, review, repair, and implementation.","id":"gh:1280212788","install_available":false,"language":"PowerShell","name":"commercial-ui-ux-codex-skill","slug":"zjsthmjialin/commercial-ui-ux-codex-skill","topics":["agent-skill","deepseek-harness","design-system","dsh","dsh-plugin","uiux"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Installable Codex skill for commercial UI/UX/GUI design, review, repair, and implementation."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Commercial UI/UX Codex Skill"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"`commercial-ui-ux` is a Codex skill for designing, reviewing, repairing, and implementing commercial"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" product interfaces."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"It helps Codex work from user tasks, business flows, interaction risk, existing design systems, acce"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ssibility, and verification gates instead of treating UI work as a color-palette or component-stylin"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"and verification gates instead of treating UI work as a color-palette or component-styling exercise."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文说明 | GitHub prerelease"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Contact author: `zjsthm@gmail.com`\nAuthor website: zjsthm.pro"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## At A Glance"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| Item | Status |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"| Skill name | `commercial-ui-ux` |\n| Current version | `0.1.0-rc.1` |\n| Release status | Public rel"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ease candidate, not a final non-RC release |\n| Main use | Commercial UI/UX/GUI design, review, repai"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"r, and implementation |\n| Best fit | SaaS tools, dashboards, admin panels, workflows, forms, tables,"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" mobile business screens |\n| Not for | Logo design, pure illustration, decorative skins, compliance "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"judgment, deceptive UI |"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## What This Skill Improves"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Commercial UI work often fails when the prompt only asks for something to look more polished. This s"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"kill pushes Codex to answer the questions that matter first:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- Who is using the interface, and what job are they trying to complete?\n- What information, states, "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"and safeguards are required for the workflow to be usable?\n- What should be preserved from the exist"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ing product or design system?\n- Where are loading, empty, error, disabled, permission, approval, rol"},{"id":"p12s4","text":"lback, and recovery states needed?\n- How can the result be checked rather than merely described as a"},{"id":"p12s5","text":" recovery states needed?\n- How can the result be checked rather than merely described as attractive?"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The intended result is not just a prettier screen. It is a more task-aware, safer, more maintainable"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" interface proposal or implementation."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Clone this repository into your Codex skills directory and keep the folder name as `commercial-ui-ux"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"one this repository into your Codex skills directory and keep the folder name as `commercial-ui-ux`."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Windows PowerShell"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### macOS / Linux"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"After installation, restart or refresh Codex, then ask it to use `commercial-ui-ux` for product inte"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"llation, restart or refresh Codex, then ask it to use `commercial-ui-ux` for product interface work."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### DeepSeek Harness (plugin)"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"`commercial-ui-ux` is also a **DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin** — one command installs the skill:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Restart DSH Web, then ask your agent to \"review this dashboard's usability\" or \"design a SaaS pricin"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"g page\" — it loads the skill and follows its workflow."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- npm: https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-commercial-ui-ux\n- Plugin source lives in the `dsh-commerci"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"al-ui-ux/` directory of this repository."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Example Request"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## How Codex Should Use It"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Start with `SKILL.md`, then read only the references needed for the current task."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Situation | Read |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| Normal UI design or implementation | `docs/01-commercial-ui-ux-rules.md` |\n| Scope, refusal, or bo"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"undary decisions | `docs/02-skill-boundaries.md` |\n| Aesthetic, usability, business, or accessibilit"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"y trade-offs | `docs/03-design-constitution.md` |\n| Helping a user write a better request | `docs/05"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"-usage-guide.md` |\n| Completion checks before claiming UI work is done | `docs/06-quality-gates.md` "},{"id":"p31s5","text":"|\n| No brand guide or reference image is provided | `docs/07-visual-strategy-inference.md` |\n| Publi"},{"id":"p31s6","text":"c project overview in Chinese | `docs/08-project-overview.zh-CN.md` |\n| Industry-specific UI pattern"},{"id":"p31s7","text":"s are needed | `docs/09-industry-taxonomy.md`, `docs/10-industry-template-library.md` |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Maintenance, validation, historical evidence, and generated output are not part of the ordinary runt"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"alidation, historical evidence, and generated output are not part of the ordinary runtime read path."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"## Included In This Public Core"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"- `SKILL.md`\n- `SKILL.zh-CN.md`\n- `README.md`\n- `README.zh-CN.md`\n- `CHANGELOG.md`\n- `VERSION`\n- `do"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"cs/01-commercial-ui-ux-rules.md`\n- `docs/02-skill-boundaries.md`\n- `docs/03-design-constitution.md`\n"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"- `docs/05-usage-guide.md`\n- `docs/06-quality-gates.md`\n- `docs/07-visual-strategy-inference.md`\n- `"},{"id":"p34s4","text":"docs/08-project-overview.zh-CN.md`\n- `docs/09-industry-taxonomy.md`\n- `docs/10-industry-template-lib"},{"id":"p34s5","text":"project-overview.zh-CN.md`\n- `docs/09-industry-taxonomy.md`\n- `docs/10-industry-template-library.md`"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Not Included"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"This public installable core intentionally excludes:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"- maintainer scripts;\n- raw validation rounds;\n- generated screenshots;\n- historical handoff notes;\n"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"- exported evaluation packages;\n- local release artifacts;\n- plugin metadata;\n- final non-RC release"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"evaluation packages;\n- local release artifacts;\n- plugin metadata;\n- final non-RC release materials."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"## Evidence Status"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The current release candidate is supported by the P6 public-release evidence group:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Evidence group | Baseline | With skill | Delta |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: |\n| P6-H1 task modelin"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"g | 76/100 | 98/100 | +22 |\n| P6-H2 existing-system repair | 64/100 | 98/100 | +34 |\n| P6-H3 risk-st"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"ate generalization | 68/100 | 98/100 | +30 |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"Average delta: about `+28.7`, above the `+25` release-preparation threshold used by this project."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"This supports the claim that the skill improves task modeling, existing-product repair, workflow sta"},{"id":"p42s2","text":"te handling, protected actions, risk recovery, and mobile continuity. It does not prove domain compl"},{"id":"p42s3","text":"iance, production readiness, or final design correctness without human review."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Boundaries"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"This skill is not:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"- a logo, poster, or illustration generator;\n- a pure color palette or styling catalog;\n- a substitu"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"te for product, design, accessibility, security, legal, medical, financial, or compliance review;\n- "},{"id":"p45s3","text":"a tool for deceptive defaults, hidden costs, fake urgency, or dark patterns."},{"id":"p46s1","text":"For existing products, the default behavior is to preserve information architecture, component seman"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"tics, routes, states, density, and visual tokens unless the user explicitly asks for a redesign."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## Version"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"Current version: `0.1.0-rc.1`"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
